{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Blocks!: Julius Caesar",
    "steam_appid": 1162670,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162670/extras/fd7066c1315ab20846328df4b7d1b1b2.webp?t=1686814960\" /></div><br><strong>Blocks!: Julius Caesar</strong> is a local and online two-player wargame that brings the drama of the Roman Civil War (49-45 BC) to life. The two players take control of the legions of Caesar or Pompey and fight to determine the future of Rome: Republic or Empire. Famous characters like Marc Antony, Cleopatra, Octavian, Scipio and Brutus all also play key roles, along with legions, cavalry, elephants, ballistas, auxilia troops and galley ships.<br><br>The victor will become the sole Master of Rome!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162670/extras/b247d9a35407086aa77be559b44073a0.webp?t=1686814960\" /></div><br>The map board depicts the major theaters of operations during the Roman Civil War, i.e the Mediterranean sea and surrounding areas, from Spain to the Middle East.<br>The object of play is to seize as many as possible of the Victory Points cities on the map. Major cities Rome and Alexandria are worth 2 VPs, the other eleven cities are each worth 1 VP. Killing the three enemy's leaders also bring 1 VP for each. The first player at 10 VP wins the game.<br><br>Will you become the Master of Rome, like Caesar, or will you perish, as Pompey did historically?<br><br>A game can be played against the <strong>Artificial Intelligence</strong> and in 2-player local Hotseat or <strong>online Multiplayer (NEW!)</strong> with your friends and fellow players on Steam.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162670/extras/609970a41bf72d8b0c375d1f4dea84b2.avif?t=1686814960\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162670/extras/fd7066c1315ab20846328df4b7d1b1b2.webp?t=1686814960\" /></div><br><strong>Blocks!: Julius Caesar</strong> is a local and online two-player wargame that brings the drama of the Roman Civil War (49-45 BC) to life. The two players take control of the legions of Caesar or Pompey and fight to determine the future of Rome: Republic or Empire. Famous characters like Marc Antony, Cleopatra, Octavian, Scipio and Brutus all also play key roles, along with legions, cavalry, elephants, ballistas, auxilia troops and galley ships.<br><br>The victor will become the sole Master of Rome!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162670/extras/b247d9a35407086aa77be559b44073a0.webp?t=1686814960\" /></div><br>The map board depicts the major theaters of operations during the Roman Civil War, i.e the Mediterranean sea and surrounding areas, from Spain to the Middle East.<br>The object of play is to seize as many as possible of the Victory Points cities on the map. Major cities Rome and Alexandria are worth 2 VPs, the other eleven cities are each worth 1 VP. Killing the three enemy's leaders also bring 1 VP for each. The first player at 10 VP wins the game.<br><br>Will you become the Master of Rome, like Caesar, or will you perish, as Pompey did historically?<br><br>A game can be played against the <strong>Artificial Intelligence</strong> and in 2-player local Hotseat or <strong>online Multiplayer (NEW!)</strong> with your friends and fellow players on Steam.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162670/extras/609970a41bf72d8b0c375d1f4dea84b2.avif?t=1686814960\" /></div>",
